Third-party software
--------------------

The installed application bundles third-party packages under their own
licences. Their notices ship with every build as THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and
are shown in the app under Help > Open Source Licences.

The website's image pipeline uses sharp, whose prebuilt binaries include
libvips, licensed under LGPL-3.0-or-later. libvips is dynamically linked and
unmodified; its source is at https://github.com/libvips/libvips.
